<h3>Teaching and curriculum</h3>
<p>Designed and taught 30 courses and workshops (2013–2022), primarily at <a href="https://srishtimanipalinstitute.in/">Srishti Manipal Institute</a> in Bangalore, spanning creative coding, algorithmic botany, physical computing, machine learning, interaction design, and human-computer interaction.</p>

<p>Designed and facilitated <a href="/notes/deconstructing-algorithms/">Deconstructing Algorithms: a thesis studio on algorithmic literacy</a> in 2020. Supervised five undergraduate students investigating explainable AI and impact-investment information.</p>

